<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Psychometric tests are a standard and scientific method used to measure your mental capabilities and behavioral style. These tests are designed to assess your suitability for different career paths based on your personality characteristics and cognitive abilities.       At Core in Career, we use proven models like the Holland RIASEC model to help you understand your interests, personality, and the kind of work environments where you would thrive. This journey of self-discovery is the first and most crucial step towards building a fulfilling and successful career.)
/E (Psychometric tests are a standard and scientific method used to measure your mental capabilities and behavioral style. These tests are designed to assess your suitability for different career paths based on your personality characteristics and cognitive abilities.       At Core in Career, we use proven models like the Holland RIASEC model to help you understand your interests, personality, and the kind of work environments where you would thrive. This journey of self-discovery is the first and most crucial step towards building a fulfilling and successful career.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
